===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|ern}}, {{m|enm|erne}}, {{m|enm|earn}}, from {{inh|en|ang|earn||eagle}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*arnu||eagle}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*arnuz||eagle}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*arô||eagle}} (whence also {{doublet|en|Arnold|notext=1}}), from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*h₃érō||large bird, eagle}}. 

Cognate with {{cog|frr|Aarn}}, {{m|frr|iarn}}, {{m|frr|jarn||eagle}}, {{cog|fy|earn||eagle}}, {{cog|nl|arend||eagle}}, {{cog|de|Aar||eagle}}, {{cog|nds|Arend||eagle}}, {{cog|da,fo,nb,nn|ørn||eagle}}, {{cog|is,sv|örn||eagle}}, {{cog|grc|ὄρνεον}}, {{m|grc|ὄρνις||bird}} (whence {{doublet|en|ornitho-|notext=1}}), {{cog|mul|-ornis}}, {{cog|sla-pro|*or%D1%8Cl%D1%8A||eagle}}.

